# Spec changes require human review. The spec library is the durable source of
# truth — scenarios, models, acceptance criteria — and the engine joins, locks,
# and gates it. Route ownership of the spec library + engine config to the spec
# owner so a spec change can't merge without their review.
#
# Replace @OWNER with the spec owner: a GitHub user (e.g. @alice) or team
# (e.g. @your-org/specs). Until you do, these rules are inert (GitHub ignores an
# unknown owner).

/features/    @OWNER
/specs/       @OWNER
/.speckit/    @OWNER
